global ordningslist, w, aktivPlats, aktivSprite

on goNext
  [  0] getglobal 45 ............................ <ordningslist>
  [  2] getglobal 48 ............................ <w>
  [  4] pusharglist 1 ........................... <w>
  [  6] extcall 38 .............................. <random(w)>
  [  8] pusharglist 2 ........................... <ordningslist, random(w)>
  [ 10] extcall 47 .............................. <getAt(ordningslist, random(w))>
  [ 12] setglobal 50 ............................ aktivSprite = getAt(ordningslist, random(w))
  [ 14] getglobal 50 ............................ <aktivSprite>
  [ 16] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 18] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 20] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite aktivSprite to 1
  [ 22] getglobal 50 ............................ <aktivSprite>
  [ 24] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 26] pushint8 30 ............................. <30>
  [ 28] set 6 ................................... set the moveableSprite of sprite aktivSprite to 1
  [ 30] getglobal 45 ............................ <ordningslist>
  [ 32] getglobal 50 ............................ <aktivSprite>
  [ 34] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <ordningslist, aktivSprite>
  [ 36] extcall 49 .............................. deleteOne(ordningslist, aktivSprite)
  [ 38] getglobal 48 ............................ <w>
  [ 40] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 42] sub ..................................... <w - 1>
  [ 43] setglobal 48 ............................ w = w - 1
  [ 45] getglobal 50 ............................ <aktivSprite>
  [ 47] pushint8 11 ............................. <11>
  [ 49] sub ..................................... <aktivSprite - 11>
  [ 50] setglobal 52 ............................ aktivPlats = aktivSprite - 11
  [ 52] ret
end
